# The Circle of Time (jeuno 65), Bugaboo killed at another Prog (GM state, charvar after the login): accepted at Prog 7,
# the Altar pops Bugaboo (noAction); a GM Prog 6, then Bugaboo killed: its onMobDeath needs Prog 7, so Prog stays 6.
lists MonasticCavern/Altar/onTrigger MonasticCavern/Bugaboo/onMobDeath
char zone=MonasticCavern pos=107.5,-3,-144 job=BRD lvl=50
quest Jeuno.TheOldMonument completed
quest Jeuno.AMinstrelInDespair completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBard completed
quest Jeuno.PainfulMemory completed
quest Jeuno.TheRequiem completed
quest Jeuno.TheCircleOfTime accepted
charvar Quest[3][65]Prog 7
keyitem StarRing1
keyitem MoonRing
login
trigger Altar                               # Prog 7: Bugaboo popped (claimed); noAction
charvar Quest[3][65]Prog 6
kill BUGABOO                                # Prog 6 (not 7): nothing; Prog stays 6
